@PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5132

### Documentação Swagger JSON
GET {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 1. Cadastrar um novo Pet (CREATE)
POST {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/pet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Rex",
  "peso": 12.5,
  "raca": 1
}

### 2. Listar todos os Pets (READ ALL)
GET {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/pet
Accept: application/json

### 3. Buscar Pet por ID (READ BY ID)
GET {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/pet/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Atualizar um Pet (UPDATE)
PUT {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/pet/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "nome": "Rex Atualizado",
  "peso": 14.0,
  "raca": 1
}

### 5. Calcular valor do banho do Pet
GET {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/pet/1/calcular-banho
Accept: application/json

### 6. Remover um Pet (DELETE)
DELETE {{PetShopSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/pet/1
